I'm packing isn't fruit punch.

259
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:07,230
Hey!

260
00:14:07,313 --> 00:14:09,577
You might think you're the
most powerful Tokomon alive,

261
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:11,457
but you're in for quite a shot.

262
00:14:11,540 --> 00:14:12,380
Static 4!

263
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,600
More money for more?

264
00:14:16,900 --> 00:14:17,760
Static 4!

265
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:25,560
You fight well, but you won't defeat me.

266
00:14:27,580 --> 00:14:29,227
Well, well, look who's here.

267
00:14:29,420 --> 00:14:32,008
We can take it from
here, Black War Koromon.

268
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:34,442
Yeah, let him try to dodge this.

269
00:14:45,260 --> 00:14:50,340
And now, to destroy this destiny
stone and summon my nemesis.

270
00:14:51,380 --> 00:14:54,851
Oh no, Black War Greymon got
past Paildramon and Silphymon.

271
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:56,557
Paildramon, come quick!

272
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:57,470
Huh?

273
00:14:59,900 --> 00:15:02,137
Do you even know what the word aim means?

274
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:03,279
Desperate blister!

275
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:19,500
Bring it on, Arcane Mon!

276
00:15:20,420 --> 00:15:22,600
Go ahead, Blackwall Koromon.

277
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:23,960
Destroy the stone.

278
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:26,097
This is worse than the last time.

279
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:29,062
At least then we didn't
have to watch it blow up.

280
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:31,090
Huh?

281
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:33,260
TK, help! Help!

282
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:34,670
Huh?

283
00:15:36,260 --> 00:15:37,090
Huh?

284
00:15:37,173 --> 00:15:38,080
Oh no, Patamon!

285
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:48,220
Patamon, Digimon, too!

286
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,840
Ready, Armadillamond!

287
00:15:57,640 --> 00:16:01,440
Digimon, Digimon monsters,
Digimon are the champions

288
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:07,960
Armadillo man, Digimon 2, Tantilloman

289
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:11,080
Digimon,

290
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:17,280
Digimon monsters, Digimon And
the big thing Era Destroyer

291
00:16:18,860 --> 00:16:20,260
Antimon, no

292
00:16:26,820 --> 00:16:27,820
Angemon, no!

293
00:16:28,420 --> 00:16:30,320
He's too mean to have a heart.

294
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:36,720
Angemon, no!

295
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:41,220
Fight, Angemon, fight!

296
00:16:41,660 --> 00:16:43,557
There must be something we can do.

297
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:45,052
He's getting pulverized.

298
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,157
Not again.

299
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,220
Not again.

300
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:54,100
It's just like when Angemon fought
Devimon and sacrificed himself to save me.

301
00:16:57,400 --> 00:16:58,230
No!

302
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,380
No, I can't let that happen again!

303
00:17:00,700 --> 00:17:02,200
I can't lose him again!

304
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:05,197
Blackboard Greymon is
just like Chimeramon,

305
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:07,477
a creation of evil that's
out of control that won't

306
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:10,360
stop until the whole
digital world is in ruins.

307
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,680
The world will end.

308
00:17:14,900 --> 00:17:16,597
Does he mean the real world?

309
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:20,020
T .K., T .K., you're right
about Black Warp Greymon.

310
00:17:20,140 --> 00:17:22,905
He must be stopped, no
matter what the cost is.

311
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:25,380
Don't worry about me. Save the world.

312
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,680
Angemon Digiball!

313
00:17:38,420 --> 00:17:40,020
Angemon Digiball 2!

314
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:50,120
Digimon, the monsters,
Digimon are the champions!

315
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:53,400
Magna Angamon, Digimon?

316
00:17:53,900 --> 00:17:55,500
Magna Angamon?

317
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,209
He digivolved to ultimate?

318
00:17:58,340 --> 00:17:59,693
The power of the stone.

319
00:18:04,260 --> 00:18:05,700
Uh-oh!

320
00:18:07,580 --> 00:18:08,410
Static!

321
00:18:08,493 --> 00:18:11,554
Mummymon might be too slow
to get away, but don't worry!

322
00:18:14,980 --> 00:18:17,540
You've turned the tide, Magna Angemon!

323
00:18:18,620 --> 00:18:24,360
You are made of pure darkness, and I cannot
allow you to stay in the digital world.

324
00:18:24,580 --> 00:18:25,520
Allow me?

325
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:28,440
Who are you to decide my fate?

326
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:30,840
I understand what a heart is for,

327
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:34,457
unlike you who thinks it means
that you can do whatever you want.

328
00:18:34,540 --> 00:18:38,577
Your irresponsibility could destroy the
whole world, so you must be stopped.

329
00:18:38,660 --> 00:18:40,720
Now prepare to feel my wrath.

330
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:44,940
Gate of Destiny

331
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:51,485
Here is the instrument of your doom,
Black Lord Greymon There will be no escape

332
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:59,580
Back to darkness with you You
are strong And almost worthy

333
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:01,580
To fight me

334
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:08,297
If I cannot win At least I will not
allow myself to be defeated by the

335
00:19:08,380 --> 00:19:12,017
likes of you You shall find that
even if you think you've beaten me,

336
00:19:12,100 --> 00:19:12,997
you really haven't.

337
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:14,845
Why don't we find out, though?

338
00:19:17,500 --> 00:19:18,540
Terror Destroyer.

339
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:24,876
Well, now, that's what I like to see.

340
00:19:24,980 --> 00:19:26,580
Another one bites the dust.

341
00:19:27,120 --> 00:19:27,950
No!

342
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:32,020
And soon now, they'll all be gone.

343
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:42,700
I've failed, TK.

344
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:44,785
The Destiny Stone's destroyed.

345
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,038
At least he's safe.

346
00:19:46,180 --> 00:19:47,356
That's what matters.

347
00:19:50,700 --> 00:19:52,880
Hey, look! What's that?

348
00:19:53,100 --> 00:19:54,000
A Digimon?

349
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:55,800
Yes, and it's in pain.

350
00:19:55,980 --> 00:19:57,020
My nemesis.

351
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:58,780
Appear and fight me.

352
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:01,880
Again, he retreats.

353
00:20:02,020 --> 00:20:03,420
He is taunting me.

354
00:20:07,860 --> 00:20:10,240
I must find the next destiny stone.

355
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:13,320
My opponent shall not escape me.

356
00:20:14,380 --> 00:20:15,760
Follow him. Right away.

357
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:20,480
Slow down.

358
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:24,037
Compared to seeing the
destiny stone destroyed,

359
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,473
this bridge doesn't seem so bad anymore.

360
00:20:27,820 --> 00:20:29,420
Good catch, Davis.

361
00:20:30,020 --> 00:20:32,785
Well, I had to make up
for missing Kari before.

362
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:34,901
You can pull her up any time now.

363
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:35,890
Our turn.

364
00:20:36,180 --> 00:20:37,400
Hey, TK. Huh?

365
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:42,114
I think I understand now why you hate
the powers of darkness like you do.

366
00:20:42,260 --> 00:20:46,260
I don't hate them, but I'm not going
to give up trying to stop them.

367
00:20:47,260 --> 00:20:49,060
TK, Cody, hurry up!

368
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:54,797
I'm gonna rock your head
if you don't be quiet.

369
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:55,710
Hmm.

370
00:20:57,980 --> 00:20:59,509
Hey, are you coming, Cody?

371
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:01,030
Yeah.

372
00:21:01,113 --> 00:21:05,220
Can the Digidestined overcome their
problems and defeat Black War Greymon?

373
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:09,140
Watch the next Digimon
Digital Monsters to find out.

374
00:21:48,600 --> 00:21:54,537
Thank you so

375
00:21:54,620 --> 00:22:00,600
much for watching.

376
00:22:38,800 --> 00:22:41,600
